assessed student performance with constructive feedback."><h3>08/2025 – Present: Adjunct Lab Instructor</h3></div><div class=timeline-entry data-content="Conducting research in the Weather and Atmosphere Thematic Area to support NOAA’s mission through climate data analysis."><h3>03/2025 – Present: NOAA EPP/MSI CESSRST-II Cohort 3 Graduate Fellow</h3></div><div class=timeline-entry data-content="Designed community workshops, led EQA’s first remote-sensing series, and conducted detailed air-quality monitoring and reporting."><h3>05/2024 – Present: Environmental Educator / Air Quality Research Analyst</h3></div><div class=timeline-entry data-content="Assessed impacts of stressors on coastal systems using satellite bio-optical tools, calibrated ocean-color data, and participated in fieldwork campaigns."><h3>2022 – 2023: Undergraduate Researcher</h3></div><div class=timeline-entry data-content="Coordinated appointments, maintained organized record-keeping systems, and supported the administrative team with data entry and outreach tasks."><h3>Summer 2023: Research Intern</h3></div><div class=timeline-entry data-content="Researched improvements to Laser-Induced Breakdown Spectroscopy via gold nanoparticles; presented results at REU symposium."><h3>Summer 2022: Undergraduate Research Intern – NSF REU</h3></div><div class=timeline-entry data-content="Led after-school enrichment activities and implemented engaging STEM lessons to support student learning and development."><h3>2017: Group Leader & STEM Coordinator</h3></div></div></div>]]></description>
                    

                    
